{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45486","headline":"饮马长城窟 · 子兰","name":"饮马长城窟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游客长城下，饮马长城窟。\n马嘶闻水腥，爲浸征人骨。\n岂不是流泉，终不成潺湲。\n洗尽骨上土，不洗骨中冤。\n骨若比流水，四海有还魂。\n空流呜咽声，声中疑是言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"子兰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45486.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45486","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}